      <formula>W</formula>
      <content><![CDATA[ denotes the execution time of a "backward for weights" chunk, and ]]></content>
      <formula><![CDATA[F\&B]]></formula>
      <content> denotes the execution time of two mutually overlapped forward and backward chunks.</content>
    </caption>
